      "source": "Reads <a href=\"query/KeyValueQuery.html#getSort()\"><code>KeyValueQuery.getSort()</code></a> of given <a href=\"query/KeyValueQuery.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.keyvalue.core.query\"><code>KeyValueQuery</code></a> and applies required transformation to match\nthe desired type.",
