      "source": "Resolves the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Sort.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Sort</code></a> object from given <a href=\"query/KeyValueQuery.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.keyvalue.core.query\"><code>KeyValueQuery</code></a> and potentially converts it into a store specific\nrepresentation that can be used by the <a href=\"QueryEngine.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.keyvalue.core\"><code>QueryEngine</code></a> implementation.",
      "translation": "从给定的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Sort.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Sort</code></a> 对象中解析出排序信息，并可能将其转换为特定存储实现所支持的表示形式，以便供 <a href=\"QueryEngine.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.keyvalue.core\"><code>QueryEngine</code></a> 使用。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
